# Private state: the extracted game scripts, the patched pack, probe dumps, evidence, the owner's saves.
#
# This lives at the bundle root as well as at the hub root on purpose. If this folder is ever extracted
# into its own repository, the hub's .gitignore does not come with it, and the contents of local/ must
# still never be published: they are a decompressed copy of the game.
local/
CGS/local/

# Build output. `build/out` is a complete ~400 MB copy of the game with the mod injected.
build/out/
build/*.pck
*.pck

# The relay's kept companies. These are player data, not source.
coop/store/
coop/*.log
coop/remote-*.cmd

# Test and tool leftovers
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
*.dmp
run_*.json
plan_*.json
pid-*.txt

# Editor and OS noise
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
